{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102703","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102703/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102703/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102703/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102703","id":2844930842,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6pkjMa","number":102703,"title":"Xbox 1708 Controller connected over Bluetooth is mapped to 2 input devices","user":{"login":"kilian-diener","id":58468519,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NDY4NTE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58468519?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener","html_url":"https://github.com/kilian-diener","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-02-11T10:14:56Z","updated_at":"2025-07-10T17:59:08Z","closed_at":"2025-07-10T15:53:38Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 3.6 and 4.3\n- Last relevant change to \"platform/windows/joypad_windows.cpp\" in commit: 81f9c0345c963ab1f06c2ed1d2d76368bdbd8f56\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta3 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - Intel(R) Core(TM) Ultra 9 185H (22 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf the Xbox 1708 controller is connected with USB it's always recognized as a __XINPUT_DEVICE__ and behaves as expected irrelevant of the used firmware version.\n\nWith a downgraded firmware version to 3.1.1221.0 and connected over Bluetooth it is recognized as a \"Bluetooth XINPUT-compatible input device\" and is working as expected as well.\n\nHowever, if the firmware is updated to the latest version 5.23.5.0 and connected over Bluetooth it is now mapped as two devices.\n- Bluetooth LE XINPUT compatible input device - 030000005e040000200b000000000000\n- __XINPUT_DEVICE__\n\nIn 2021 Microsoft added Bluetooth LE support to this controller and it looks like that change is not correctly reflected in Godot.\n\nThere is a closed PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/89587 which adresses the issue and if I recompile Godot with these changes only 1 \"Bluetooth LE XINPUT compatible input device\" is detected. Sadly, I don't have the other ones to verify the rest of the changes.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Update Controller to latest firmware (5.23.5.0)\n2. Connect controller over Bluetooth\n3. Run the AssetLibrary project \"Joypads (Gamepads) Demo\"\n4. Check console output\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nUse \"Joypads (Gamepads) Demo\" from the AssetLibrary","closed_by":{"login":"kilian-diener","id":58468519,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NDY4NTE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58468519?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener","html_url":"https://github.com/kilian-diener","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilian-diener/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102703/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godote